        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-BRK004HMRSAL, Hammered Boulder Shower Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Square Boulder Shower Door Knob Set comes with everything you'll need to install it on a glass door. It is packaged with 2 knobs--one for each side of the door--and the back-to-back mounting hardware for glass installation. The Hammered Boulder Shower Door Knob is available in a huge selection of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Boulder Series 3 Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BLD03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions SD-BRK004HMRSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls and mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
